==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|beinn|lang=non}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/peitn/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|eitn|lang=is}}

===Adjective===
{{is-adj-01|bein|beint|beinni|beinastur}}

# [[straight]], [[right]]
#: ''Maðurinn [[standa|stendur]] '''beinn'''.
#:: The man [[stands]] '''straight'''.

